            "body": "> I have a quiet Neovim setup and definitely don't need ~100 screen redraws per second.\n\nIt was mostly added because I noticed that notifications in the background (like LSP progress reports) did not update at all. I imagine seeing the progress report stuck while using picker is confusing and \"progress is still going just Neovim does not redraw\" is not the first explanation that comes to mind.\n\nI'll think about maybe changing it to 100 ms, though.",
