            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "> The behavior of not redrawing seems to be more aligned with other modes (like Command-line mode) and the only issue I had with \"background drawing\" was 'mini.notify' which works.\n\nAgreed, this is the ideal behavior for me. It's rare that something changes on screen without input, and if something did change I'm probably not looking at it anyways when a picker is open.\n\nI normally use the latest release, but I'll use `main` until 0.18 and will let you know if I notice any regressions that might be related to this change. Thanks again @echasnovski.",
